<title>USA: Bandag to acquire Universal Tire.</title>
<headline>Bandag to acquire Universal Tire.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandag Inc said Wednesday it has entered into a memorandum of understanding to acquire all of the outstanding stock of Universal Tire Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Universal Tire operates seven Bandag franchises.</p>
<p>Bandag makes retreading materials and equipment for its worldwide network of over 1,300 independent franchised dealers who produce and market cold process retreads.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
